  "instructions": [
    "Cook penne in a large pot of salted boiling water until al dente, then drain and set aside.",
    "In a skillet, heat olive oil over medium heat, add minced garlic and diced onion, sauté until translucent.",
    "Add minced red chili and smoked paprika, cook for 1 minute until fragrant.",
    "Stir in tomato paste and diced tomatoes, simmer for 5 minutes to reduce.",
    "Transfer mixture to a bain-marie setup and whisk in heavy cream until smooth.",
    "Return sauce to the skillet, heat gently, then stir in grated parmesan until melted.",
    "Season with salt and black pepper to taste.",
    "Toss the cooked penne into the sauce, combine thoroughly.",
    "Garnish with chopped fresh parsley before serving."
  ],
